   "text": "④ Backups\nDaily changes + weekly full.\nCheap. Restore takes minutes\nto hours and loses writes\nsince the last backup.",
   "originalText": "④ Backups\nDaily changes + weekly full.\nCheap. Restore takes minutes\nto hours and loses writes\nsince the last backup.",
